# Loaded by `npm run build` only, so the deployed origin belongs here and nowhere else.
#
# It was in `.env`, which Vite loads in *every* mode — so `npm run dev` called the deployed box and
# local changes silently had no effect. Moving it here keeps the production build pointing exactly
# where it did while letting development reach the local mock server.
#
# No trailing slash: client.ts appends paths that begin with one.
VITE_API_BASE=https://cw.vriodigital.com
